  "description": "“Let’s Make Them Mistake a Ruined World for a Game” Kim Jinwoo, a game director, was one day summoned to another world called “Arsilan.” After struggling through a harsh life, he eventually rose to become an archmage. However, Arsilan was on the brink of destruction due to entities known as “Erosion.” Jinwoo, who came from Earth, was the only one immune to Erosion. But even as an archmage, facing countless Erosions alone within the short span of three years was impossible. “I suppose I want to let everything go and rest now.” Just as Jinwoo gave up on everything and emptied his mind, he became a Transcendent. Through the “Gate of Souls,” an absolute authority he obtained upon becoming a Transcendent, Jinwoo gained the ability to travel between Earth and Arsilan. Using the Gate of Souls, he began summoning Earthlings—who were also immune to Erosion—to Arsilan, making them believe it was a game and having them fight against the Erosion. Thus began the project known as the “Arsilan Saga Project.”\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
